armland-atlas/new-york/jefferson-county"],["ARC or PLC in Jefferson County","/arc-plc/new-york/jefferson-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Jefferson County record runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years in all. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids, May to June, June to July and July to August each came in under 90% of normal in 32 of those years. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 70% of normal in July to August and 50% in August to September. Grid 29016 had its driest year in 1964 at 73% of normal.</p>"}
